Z||000000||Raydar||10-03-2001||09:15 AM||||A woman woke in the middle of the night to find her husband missing from their bed. In the stillness of the house, she could hear a muffled sound downstairs. She went downstairs and looked all around, still not finding her husband. Listening again, she could definitely hear moaning. She went down to the basement to find her husband, crouched in the corner facing the wall, sobbing.<BR>“What’s wrong with you?” she asked him.<BR>“Remember when your father caught us having sex when you were 16?” he replied. “And remember he said, I had two choices: I could either marry you, or spend the next 20 years in prison.”<BR>Baffled, she said, “Yes, I remember... so?” <P>“I would have gotten out today.” <BR><P>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><BR>Black 88 Formula.<BR>Red 88 Duke coupe. "The Project" <BR>88 Formula parts car. "The Donor"<BR></FONT>||||reg||1
Z||000001||88CoupeV6||10-03-2001||10:32 AM||||LMAO  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Here is one I have <BR>A guy comes home from work and his wife is MAD at him, He asks her for<BR>supper and she just about THROWS it at him. He asks for a beer and she SLAMS<BR>it down on the table. He says "what's your problem?" she tells him "I WAS<BR>TALKING TO THE NEIGHBORS TODAY" He says "yeah so?" She says "THEY TOLD ME<BR>SOMETHING ABOUT YOU" He goes "What?" "They said you were a pedophile"  (He<BR>looks surprised) and tells her "WOW, That is an awful big word for a 12 year<BR>old."   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P><BR>--------<BR>Josh||||reg||7
